# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Target repos under test. This plugin documents *other* people's services, so
# a checkout of one sitting in the working tree is an input, never content --
# and this repo is public and MIT-licensed, which makes an accidental `git add
# -A` of a private service an unringable bell. Ignore by name rather than
# relying on remembering.
/target-repo/
